step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Alec Kincade</col> outside the <col=800000>Myths' Guild</col> (spirit tree to Feldip Hills) to start the quest.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Alec Kincade outside the Myths' Guild (spirit tree to Feldip Hills) to start the quest.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Dallas Jones</col> at the Karamja pub at <col=800000>Musa Point</col>. The fastest way there is amulet of glory to karamja, alternativley to take the boat from <col=800000>Port Sarim</col>.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Alec Kincade outside the Myths' Guild (spirit tree to Feldip Hills) to start the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Dallas Jones at the Karamja pub at Musa Point. The fastest way there is amulet of glory to karamja, alternativley to take the boat from Port Sarim.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to Elvarg's Lair under <col=800000>Crandor</col> and talk to Dallas Jones (shortcut via the volcano on Karamja).</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Alec Kincade outside the Myths' Guild (spirit tree to Feldip Hills) to start the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Dallas Jones at the Karamja pub at Musa Point. The fastest way there is amulet of glory to karamja, alternativley to take the boat from Port Sarim.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Elvarg's Lair under Crandor and talk to Dallas Jones (shortcut via the volcano on Karamja).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Right-click use your pickaxe on the Northern wall in the room you defeated Elvarg, then enter the tunnel. (Marked on minimap red wall line)</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Talk to Alec Kincade outside the Myths' Guild (spirit tree to Feldip Hills) to start the quest.</str>
