line	
line	<str>Search the stone chest for a dragon key piece and an ancient key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the crypt whose entrance is found in the southern part of the Graveyard of Heroes. Follow the dirt path south to a small building.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the bottom of the crypt and inspect the tomb to find the puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>The solution to the puzzle is different for everyone. Refer to the table below to solve this puzzle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the tomb to get the Dragon key piece.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Ancient Cavern (use a games necklace to teleport to Barbarian Outpost and run south to the whirlpool).</str>
line	
line	<str>Descend the stairs and run south to another set of stairs which lead to the mithril dragon area.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run west and open the mithril door in the middle of the area (with the three mithril dragons clumped together). You need the ancient key to open this door.</str>
